{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（26日）早上近8時，元朗錦田街巿一名魚檔檔主報案，指返回開檔發現有魚不見了，懷疑被人偷去。 警方到場調查列盜竊，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>姓王檔主在場稱，後門沒有上鎖，確實損失的數量有待點算，暫時未能確定；初步估計約2千元。</p><figure><img alt=\"魚檔老檔感到無奈。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202569143333949440926015.jpeg/P7a-r0wNNmBsfJcA4O3PP3ars0oV6-6Yvw_Qrr8P0K4\"/><figcaption>魚檔老檔感到無奈。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魚檔被偷走一批魚，剩下幾條出售。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202569140787875840267543.jpeg/tkHahsS7EpiltOj_ELWwSc9G7MqbEnZ53xnuId8Z7iE\"/><figcaption>魚檔被偷走一批魚，剩下幾條出售。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是錦田街巿一個魚檔。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202569137948200960516294.jpeg/Ya3LL8ejTi6_5HzrXktoxR5nqbHlS39yjHfzRIx380Q\"/><figcaption>現場是錦田街巿一個魚檔。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:39:20.351776+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:27:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T02:32:33.612166+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:32:33.612166+00:00","content_hash":"f09e6e28b036b3a7cbc254352a7d567e838670f3276d3f16a6c5b52555c2a4d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}